# nagios_plugins

A collection of [Nagios](https://www.nagios.org/) / [Icinga](https://icinga.com/)
plugins for monitoring hardware, network devices, backups and misc services.

## Requirements

Each plugin has its own runtime dependencies. The notable external ones:

Run any plugin with `--help` (or `-h`) for its specific options and usage.

